:: School Rear Pick Fight
<<schooleffects>><<effects>>
<<if maleChance(`$player.gender is "m"? "f": "m"`)>>
    <<generatesm1>>
<<else>>
    <<generatesf1>>
<</if>>
<<person1>>

You approach the group, and start provoking one of the delinquents there. You mock <<his>> face and crowd erupts in laughter, and ask <<him>> if <<hes>> gonna take it lying down.
<br><br>

Your provocations turn out quite effective, and shortly after you're both squaring up, readying yourselves for a fight.
<br><br>

<<link [[Shove|School Rear Fight]]>><<set $fightstart to 1>><</link>>

:: School Rear Fight
<<if $fightstart is 1>>
	<<set $fightstart to 0>>
	<<neutral 1>>
	<<maninit>>
	<<set $enemytrust -= 100>>
	<<set $enemyanger += 200>>
	<<npcidlegenitals>>
    <<if $delinquency lt 400>><<enable_rescue>><</if>>
<</if>>

<<if $combatpill is 1>>
	<<unset $combatpill>>
	<<controlloss>>
	<<violence 1>>
	<<neutral 1>>
    <<xchange-random-spike "suppress">><<hand_gag 0 left>>
    Unable to bear the pain any further, you're knocked on your back. And as you struggle to regain your senses, the <<person>> climbs on top of you and forces a pill down your throat.
    <br><br>
	<<molested>>
    <<reversenpcidlegenitals>>
<</if>>

<<effects>>
<<effectsman>>
<<alarmstate "<span class='red'>No one comes to your aid, likely due to your reputation as a delinquent.</span>">>
<<man>>
<<audience>>
<<stateman>>
<br><br>
<<actionsman>>

<<rng 3>>
<<if !playerIsXChanged() and $pain gte 100 and $willpowerpain is 0 and $rng is 0>>
    <span id="next"><<link [[Next|School Rear Fight]]>><<set $combatpill to 1>><</link>></span><<nexttext>>
<<elseif _combatend or ($pain gte 100 and $willpowerpain is 0)>>
	<span id="next"><<link [[Next|School Rear Fight Finish]]>><</link>></span><<nexttext>>
<<else>>
	<span id="next"><<link [[Next|School Rear Fight]]>><</link>></span><<nexttext>>
<</if>>

:: School Rear Fight Finish
<<effects>>
<<if $enemyarousal gte $enemyarousalmax>>
	<<ejaculation>>
	Still slightly dizzy from <<his>> orgasm, the <<person>> loses <<his>> will to fight and walks away. 
	<br><br>
	<<tearful>> you recover.
	<br><br>
	<<clotheson>>
	<<endcombat>>
	<<link [[Next|School Rear Courtyard]]>><</link>>

<<elseif $enemyhealth lte 0>>
	With one last hit, you knock <<his>> smug ass into the ground, showing <<him>> who's boss.
	<br><br>
    It seems in the heat of the fight, the <<person>> dropped <<his>> wallet containing <<moneyGainDisplay 20 true true>>
	<<tearful>> you regain some of your composure and ponder whether to take the money or not.
    <<status 2>><<ggcool>>
	<br><br>
	<<clotheson>>
	<<endcombat>>
    <<link [[Take money|School Rear Courtyard]]>><<moneyGain _money_gain false true>><</link>><<crime "petty">>
    <br>
	<<link [[Walk away|School Rear Courtyard]]>><</link>>

<<else>>
	Too beat up to continue fighting, you protect yourself with your arms until the <<person>> stops hitting you. Still somewhat pissed, <<he>> mocks your sorry state before finally walking away. 
	<br><br>
	<<tearful>> you pick yourself up, with your pride in shambles.
    <<status -2>><<llcool>>
	<br><br>
	<<clotheson>>
	<<endcombat>>
	<<link [[Next|School Rear Courtyard]]>><</link>>

<</if>>